[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":185},"routes/guides.$slug",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8},"guide",{"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22,"_23":24,"_25":26,"_27":28,"_29":30},"title","Couples Halloween Costumes: 14 Easy Last-Minute Ideas (2026)","slug","couples-halloween-costumes","category","couple-style","seoTitle","Couples Halloween Costumes 2026: 14 Easy, Funny & Last-Minute Ideas","metaDescription","14 easy couples Halloween costumes for 2026: funny pairs, cozy onesies and 5-minute last-minute ideas you can still get before Halloween.","image","https://images.pexels.com/photos/18676949/pexels-photo-18676949.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1216&h=912&fit=crop","imageAlt","A couple dressed as ghosts with sunglasses","intro","Halloween is in a few days, the party invite is in your chat, and you two still have no costume. Breathe. These couples costumes are easy, funny and comfortable, and most of them are one click away. Some are full matching sets, some are just two pieces that make the joke work. Our top pick: matching skeleton onesies. Cozy, cute in photos, and he will actually agree to wear it. Order today, Halloween week is busy for delivery.","sections",[78,79,80,81],"comparison",{"_45":46,"_47":48},"faq",[31,32,33,34],{"_35":43,"_37":44},{"_35":41,"_37":42},{"_35":39,"_37":40},{"_35":36,"_37":38},"question","Will a costume arrive before Halloween?","answer","Check the delivery date on Amazon before you order. In Halloween week, order as early as you can or pick items with fast delivery.","How do I get my boyfriend to wear a couples costume?","Pick something comfortable (onesies win) or funny. Guys say yes much faster when the costume is a joke or feels like pajamas.","What is a good last-minute couples costume?","Halo and horns headbands with white and black outfits, two white sheet ghosts, or a vampire cape with fangs. Most ship fast on Amazon.","What are easy couples Halloween costumes?","Matching onesies (skeletons, dinosaurs, cows), angel and devil headbands, or a funny pair like plug and socket. All of them go on in under 5 minutes.","columns",[75,76,77],"rows",[49,50,51,52,53],{"_54":72,"_56":73},{"_54":68,"_56":69},{"_54":64,"_56":65},{"_54":60,"_56":61},{"_54":55,"_56":57},"label","Halo and horns","values",[58,59],"Last minute","Super easy","Vampire cape + fangs",[62,63],"Romantic, dark look","Easy","Plug and socket",[66,67],"Most laughs","Easy over clothes","Dinosaur onesies",[70,71],"Funny + warm","Very comfy","Skeleton onesies",[74,71],"Cute photos","Costume","Best for","Comfort",{"_82":158,"_84":159,"_86":160},{"_82":131,"_84":132,"_86":133},{"_82":104,"_84":105,"_86":106},{"_82":83,"_84":85,"_86":87},"heading","Last-minute heroes","text","Cheap, fast and still cute. Perfect if the party is tomorrow.","products",[88,89],{"_90":99,"_19":100,"_93":101,"_95":102,"_97":103},{"_90":91,"_19":92,"_93":94,"_95":96,"_97":98},"name","Any idea, one base: unisex hooded jumpsuit","https://images.pexels.com/photos/9147706/pexels-photo-9147706.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","alt","Two people in red and black costumes","description","A plain hooded jumpsuit you can turn into a devil, ninja or skeleton with face paint. Over 1,600 reviews.","amazonUrl","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PZ8Y3SZ?tag=relations0237-20","Pumpkin pair: pumpkin costume set","https://images.pexels.com/photos/14234270/pexels-photo-14234270.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Two people in white sheets holding pumpkins","A 3-piece pumpkin set that fits over leggings or jeans. Cute, comfy and very photo friendly. Over 900 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CHQJLQTC?tag=relations0237-20","Romantic and a little dark","For couples who want to look good, not funny.",[107,108,109,110],{"_90":126,"_19":127,"_93":128,"_95":129,"_97":130},{"_90":121,"_19":122,"_93":123,"_95":124,"_97":125},{"_90":116,"_19":117,"_93":118,"_95":119,"_97":120},{"_90":111,"_19":112,"_93":113,"_95":114,"_97":115},"Witchy pair: classic witch hat","https://images.pexels.com/photos/5422773/pexels-photo-5422773.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","A witch hat on a spider web","A big floppy witch hat for her (or a wizard look for him). Add a black dress and you are ready. Over 1,000 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092HTR6KR?tag=relations0237-20","Angel and devil: halo and horns headbands","https://images.pexels.com/photos/6617259/pexels-photo-6617259.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","A devil mask with red horns","The fastest couples costume ever: a halo for one, horns for the other. Wear with white and black outfits. Over 600 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BRGD2TR?tag=relations0237-20","The detail that sells it: custom fangs","https://images.pexels.com/photos/15124243/pexels-photo-15124243.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","A man with vampire fangs","Real-looking fangs you mold to your teeth at home. The tiny thing that makes the costume. Over 11,000 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000RUJJAU?tag=relations0237-20","Date-night look: vampire cape","https://images.pexels.com/photos/14395498/pexels-photo-14395498.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","A woman in a vampire costume with a red background","A dramatic black and red cape that turns any black outfit into a vampire look. Get one for each of you. Over 1,000 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BW5D4QV?tag=relations0237-20","Funny pairs (he is the joke, you are the punchline)","Costumes that only make sense together, so everyone knows you came as a couple.",[134,135,136,137],{"_90":153,"_19":154,"_93":155,"_95":156,"_97":157},{"_90":148,"_19":149,"_93":150,"_95":151,"_97":152},{"_90":143,"_19":144,"_93":145,"_95":146,"_97":147},{"_90":138,"_19":139,"_93":140,"_95":141,"_97":142},"Spooky classic: Ghost Face costume","https://images.pexels.com/photos/9846847/pexels-photo-9846847.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Two people dressed as ghosts on a road","The horror movie robe and mask he can throw on in 1 minute. Pair it with a white sheet ghost for you. Over 3,400 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0027VT61Y?tag=relations0237-20","Clean humor: loofah and soap","https://images.pexels.com/photos/5420794/pexels-photo-5420794.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","A trick or treat sign with orange decorations","A funny, family-friendly pair that slips over your clothes in seconds. Over 600 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DK3CXSC?tag=relations0237-20","Silly and sweet: peanut butter and jelly","https://images.pexels.com/photos/35872896/pexels-photo-35872896.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","A couple dancing at a party","Two foam tunics, one perfect pair. Easy to wear over normal clothes. Over 900 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W44J522?tag=relations0237-20","Most laughs: plug and socket","https://images.pexels.com/photos/7080397/pexels-photo-7080397.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","A couple in funny matching costumes","The classic couples joke costume. People will take photos of you all night. Over 1,900 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W45HH8M?tag=relations0237-20","The easiest matching costumes","Zero thinking, zero sewing. Put it on, take the photo, done.",[161,162,163,164],{"_90":180,"_19":181,"_93":182,"_95":183,"_97":184},{"_90":175,"_19":176,"_93":177,"_95":178,"_97":179},{"_90":170,"_19":171,"_93":172,"_95":173,"_97":174},{"_90":165,"_19":166,"_93":167,"_95":168,"_97":169},"Cutest photos: cow onesies","https://images.pexels.com/photos/31794126/pexels-photo-31794126.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","A white cow in a green field","Soft flannel cow onesies that double as winter pajamas after Halloween. Over 4,000 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX3SD321?tag=relations0237-20","Cozy option: dinosaur onesies","https://images.pexels.com/photos/11743337/pexels-photo-11743337.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","A red dinosaur head under neon light","Two T-Rex onesies and you are the funniest couple at the party. Warm enough for trick-or-treat walks too. Over 5,800 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0145JTYDA?tag=relations0237-20","His match: unisex skeleton costume","https://images.pexels.com/photos/8471922/pexels-photo-8471922.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","A skeleton standing in a room","The matching skeleton jumpsuit for him, so you two look like one creepy-cute team. Over 2,000 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F2RFV6L?tag=relations0237-20","Top pick: skeleton onesie for her","https://images.pexels.com/photos/5428147/pexels-photo-5428147.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","A skeleton on a white background","A soft hooded skeleton onesie that looks great in photos and feels like pajamas. Pair it with his skeleton suit below. Over 8,000 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01I0Q2QB6?tag=relations0237-20",{"_186":187},"origin","https://relationshipgoals.store"]
